{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"三年春王正月，溺會齊師伐衛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"夏四月，葬宋莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"五月，葬桓王。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"秋，紀季以酅入于齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"冬，公次于滑。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"三年春，溺會齊師伐衛，疾之也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"夏五月，葬桓王，緩也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"秋，紀季以酅入于齊，紀於是乎始判。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_32_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_32","textTraditional":"冬，公次于滑，將會鄭伯，謀紀故也。鄭伯辭以難。凡師，一宿為舍，再宿為信，過信為次。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}